{"id": "22-497-2-2", "zh": "重复连声", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-498-2-5", "zh": "现在阐明重复连声。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-499-2-4", "zh": "重复有三种。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-499-5-12", "zh": "其中，pakkamo、parakkamo 等，称为辅音重复。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-499-13-19", "zh": "rukkhaṃ rukkhaṃ siñcati（一棵一棵地浇灌树木）等，称为带格尾的词重复。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-499-20-30", "zh": "titikkhā、tikicchā、jagamā、jagamu 等，称为词根重复。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-500-2-20", "zh": "53. 元音之后重复。[ka.28; rū.40; nī.67]", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-501-2-9", "zh": "在元音之后，后面的辅音有时变成两个。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-502-2-11", "zh": "其中，在元音之后，pa、pati、paṭi 的 p 重复——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-503-2-26", "zh": "appamādo、idhappamādo、vippayutto、sammappadhānaṃ、appativattiyaṃ dhammacakkaṃ［大品 17］、suppatiṭṭhito、appaṭipuggalo、vippaṭisāro、suppaṭipanno 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-504-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“元音之后”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-504-5-6", "zh": "因为有 sampayutto 这样的情况（不重复）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-505-2-36", "zh": "kī、kudha、kamu、kusa、gaha、juta、ñā、si、su、sambhu、sara、sasa 等词根，以及以 u、du、ni 为前缀的词，其词首辅音重复。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-506-2-4", "zh": "kī——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-507-2-7", "zh": "vikkināti、vikkayo、dhanakkīto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-508-2-3", "zh": "kudha——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-509-2-5", "zh": "akkuddho、akkodho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-510-2-3", "zh": "kamu——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-511-2-25", "zh": "abhikkamati、abhikkamo、abhikkanto、akkamati、akkamo、akkanto、parakkamati、parakkamo、vikkamati、vikkamo、okkamati、okkanto。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-512-2-3", "zh": "kusa——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-513-2-5", "zh": "akkosati、akkoso。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-514-2-3", "zh": "gaha——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-515-2-11", "zh": "paggaṇhāti、paggaho、viggaho、pariggaho、anuggaho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-516-2-3", "zh": "juta——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-517-2-5", "zh": "ujjotati、vijjotati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-518-2-3", "zh": "ñā——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-519-2-19", "zh": "aññā、paññā、abhiññā、pariññā、viññāṇaṃ、sabbaññutaññāṇaṃ、rattaññū、atthaññū、dhammaññū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-520-2-3", "zh": "si——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-521-2-7", "zh": "atissayo、bhūmassito、gehassito。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-522-2-3", "zh": "su——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-523-2-11", "zh": "appassuto、bahussuto、vissuto、assavo、anassavo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-524-2-4", "zh": "sambhu——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-525-2-7", "zh": "passambhati、passaddhi、passaddho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-526-2-3", "zh": "sara——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-527-2-7", "zh": "anussarati、anussati、anussaro。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-528-2-3", "zh": "sasa——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-529-2-9", "zh": "assasati、assasanto、assāso、passāso。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-530-2-3", "zh": "saja——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-531-2-7", "zh": "vissajjeti、vissajjanto、vissaggo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-532-2-3", "zh": "caja——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-533-2-8", "zh": "pariccajati、pariccajanto、pariccāgo 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-534-2-3", "zh": "以 u 为前缀时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-535-2-24", "zh": "ukkaṃsati、ukkaṃso、uggaho、uccāreti、uccāro、uccayo、samuccayo、ujjalo、samujjalo、uṇṇamati、uttarati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-536-2-3", "zh": "以 du 为前缀时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-537-2-24", "zh": "dukkaṭaṃ、dukkaraṃ、duggati、duccaritaṃ、duttaro、duddamo、dunnayo、dupposo、dubbalo、dummaggo、dullabho 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-538-2-3", "zh": "以 ni 为前缀时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-539-2-28", "zh": "nikkamo、nikkhanto、niggato、niccoro、nijjaro、niddoso、nippāpo、nimmito、nimmāno、niyyānaṃ、nillolo、nibbānaṃ、nissayo 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-540-2-9", "zh": "tika、taya、tiṃsa 的 t 重复——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-541-2-13", "zh": "kusalattikaṃ、vedanattikaṃ、vatthuttayaṃ、ratanattayaṃ、dvattiṃsaṃ、tettiṃsaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-542-2-8", "zh": "在 catu、cha 之后，后面的辅音重复——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-543-2-13", "zh": "catubbidhaṃ、catuddasa、catuddisaṃ、catuppadaṃ、chabbidhaṃ、channavuti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-544-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“可选”？", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-544-5-8", "zh": "因为有 catusaccaṃ、chasataṃ 这样不重复的情况。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-545-2-7", "zh": "santa 变为 sa 时，后面的辅音一定重复——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-546-2-13", "zh": "sajjano、sappuriso、saddhammo；santa 的状态是 sattā；sabbhāvo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-547-2-6", "zh": "v 变为 b 时，b 重复——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-548-2-10", "zh": "sīlabbataṃ、nibbānaṃ、nibbutaṃ 等，前面已经讲过。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-549-2-8", "zh": "vatu、vaṭu 等词根的末尾辅音重复——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-550-2-13", "zh": "vattati、pavattati、nivattati、saṃvattati、vaṭṭati、vivaṭṭati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-551-2-6", "zh": "在 saṃ 之后，anu 的 n 重复——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-552-2-7", "zh": "samannāgato、samannāhāro、samannesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-553-2-3", "zh": "其他地方也有——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-554-2-33", "zh": "sīmaṃ sammanneyya［大品 139］、sīmaṃ sammannituṃ［大品 138］、sīmaṃ sammannati［大品 139］、sampaṭicchannaṃ、cīvaracetāpannaṃ、catunnaṃ、pañcannaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-555-2-4", "zh": "以上是同音重复部分。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-556-2-36", "zh": "54. 第四音、第二音在后时，它们的重复变为第三音、第一音。[ka.44,29; rū.24; nī.57,68,74,77-8,80,82-3,91,122]", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-557-2-21", "zh": "在同组辅音中，后面是第四音、第二音时，这些第四音、第二音的重复依次变为第三音、第一音；“变为重复”的意思是成为它们的副音。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-557-22-50", "zh": "依“元音之后重复”这条规则，或依“vaggalasehi te”等规则，第二音、第四音先成为同音重复，再依本条规则，前一个第二音变为第一音，前一个第四音变为第三音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-558-2-4", "zh": "其中，在 k 组——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-559-2-17", "zh": "ākkhātaṃ、pakkhittaṃ、pakkhepo、rūpakkhandho、vedanākkhandho、dhātukkhobho、āyukkhayo、nakkhamati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-560-2-8", "zh": "依“vaggalasehi te”这条规则的规定——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-561-2-11", "zh": "在前面就好，所以是 pāmokkhaṃ；paggharati、ugghosati、nigghoso。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-562-2-3", "zh": "在 c 组——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-563-2-53", "zh": "acchādeti、acchindati（在复辅音前元音变短）、pacchādeti、pacchindati、setacchattaṃ、rukkhacchāyā；如实的状态是 tacchaṃ；对车有益的是 racchā；pajjhāyati、ujjhāyati、nijjhāyati、paṭhamajjhānaṃ、dutiyajjhānaṃ、ajjhokāso、bojjhaṅgo；愚钝的状态是 dummejjhaṃ；bujjhati、bujjhitabbaṃ、bojjhaṃ、paṭivijjha、paṭivijjhiya、paṭivijjhitvā 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-564-2-3", "zh": "在 ṭ 组——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-565-2-16", "zh": "yatraṭṭhitaṃ、tatraṭṭhito、uṭṭhito、niṭṭhito、thalaṭṭho、jalaṭṭho、vuḍḍho 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-566-2-3", "zh": "在 t 组——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-567-2-34", "zh": "sumanatthero、yasatthero、avatthā、avatthānaṃ、vitthāro、abhitthuto、vitthambhito、uddharati、uddharaṇaṃ、uddhaṭaṃ、niddhāreti、niddhāraṇaṃ、niddhāritaṃ、niddhano、niddhuto、niddhoto 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-568-2-3", "zh": "在 p 组——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-569-2-41", "zh": "vippharati、vippharaṇaṃ、vipphāro、apphoṭeti、mahapphalaṃ、nipphalaṃ、madhupphāṇitaṃ、vibbhamati、vibbhamo、ubbhataṃ、nibbhayaṃ、dubbharo、sabbhāvo；公牛的状态是 osabbhaṃ；labbhati、ārabbho、ārabbha、ārabbhitvā 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-570-2-13", "zh": "这里也特别主张：在 u、du、ni 之后，后续词的词首辅音重复。", "confidence": 80}
